Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.18,0:00:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The Princess Sapphire\NKnight of the Ribbon
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k72}{\k14}A{\k32}ta{\k40}shi {\k48}no {\k35}mi{\k52}ru {\k45}yu{\k34}me{\k30} {\k41}hi{\k44}mi{\k43}tsu {\k27}na{\k39}no{\k20}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:50.16,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The dreams I see are my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k53}{\k24}Da{\k13}re{\k25} {\k40}ni {\k36}mo {\k68}iwa{\k68}nai{\k56} {\k43}hi{\k40}mi{\k55}tsu {\k31}na{\k32}no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.25,0:00:57.09,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k27}{\k45}A{\k26}ka{\k22}i {\k43}man{\k19}to {\k40}hi{\k26}ra {\k23}hi{\k75}ra{\k46}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.54,0:01:02.46,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,A red cape fluttering
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k0}{\k12}U{\k25}ma {\k21}o {\k18}to{\k28}ba{\k15}su {\k91}ou{\k42}jo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.46,0:01:04.98,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Galloping on a horse—the princess
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k28}So{\k27}re {\k21}ga {\k15}a{\k12}{\k23}ta{\k31}shi{\k35}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.98,0:01:06.90,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,That’s me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.62,0:01:10.90,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.91,0:01:13.42,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:18.02,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k12}Lu{\k38}la{\k11} {\k20}du{\k10}la{\k19} {\k48}lu{\k53}la {\k43}du{\k40}la{\k22}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.14,0:01:20.74,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k23}{\k26}Lu{\k26}lu{\k13} {\k49}laa, {\k19}lu{\k40}laa{\k55}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k12}{\k52}Ri{\k44}bon {\k38}no {\k35}ki{\k59}shi {\k115}wa{\k17}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.50,0:01:25.22,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,The Knight of the Ribbon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k6}{\k50}Hon{\k43}to {\k33}wa {\k92}hon{\k43}tto {\k49}wa{\k24}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.22,0:01:28.62,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,Truly, truly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,Karaoke,,0,0,0,,{\k18}{\k23}A{\k23}ta{\k27}shi {\k35}na{\k35}no {\k159}sa{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:31.82,OPED_Translation,,0,0,0,,It’s really me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.10,0:01:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thirty-Third Episode\NThe Egyptian Adventure
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.42,0:02:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Here on the sea there is a lot of mist,\Nespecially in winter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.42,0:02:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Often we don't notice the enemy\Nbecause of the mist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.42,0:02:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A day like today\Nis very dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.14,0:02:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,therefore it is important\Nto stay well on guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.98,0:02:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,An enemy ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.10,0:02:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows where it comes from...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What could this possibly be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.42,0:02:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.\NWhere do you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.58,0:03:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why are you wearing this\Niron ring? - I escaped!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.38,0:03:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, be kind, take this\Nhorrible iron ring off me at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, I can't take it off you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.50,0:03:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This iron ring is the symbol\Nof the sacrifice to the deity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Sacrifice, you said?\NWhat sacrifice?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year, ten girls are\Nburied alive underground...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.22,0:03:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,...as a sacrifice to the\Ndeity! Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Buried alive?! How is\Nsuch cruelty possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The persecutors are coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.02,0:03:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- Quick, help me escape!\N- Hide behind the Fort! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:52.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't open anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.34,0:04:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Which country's soldiers are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.02,0:04:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Girl destined for sacrifice,\Nwhy did you run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.26,0:04:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- You will be severely punished!\N- But what are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.26,0:04:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Sapphire, the\NPrincess of Silverland!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.14,0:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You cannot deceive us\Neven if you have changed your clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.02,0:04:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You are a girl of our country\Nand the iron ring is the proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough! Take her to the ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.90,0:05:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm tired, let me sleep!\N- Come on, wake up! You lazybones!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.42,0:05:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you awake, beautiful girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.22,0:05:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? And where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.18,0:05:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you still trying\Nto feign ignorance?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no one in the world\Nwho doesn't know this country!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.90,0:05:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that\Ngreat seaside city...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...and look at those three\Ngreat pyramids in the desert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.30,0:05:45.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Great seaside city...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.22,0:05:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Pyramids..!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.18,0:05:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So, according to Dr. Uranaru,\Nthis country is Egypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.34,0:05:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the largest city\Nin Egypt: Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.30,0:06:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am Morufo,\Nthe celebrant of rites.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.02,0:06:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Morufo? Listen, Morufo,\Nyou're wrong, I am not that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:09.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you still intend\Nto feign ignorance?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.86,0:06:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think it's very honorable\Nto be a sacrificial victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.94,0:06:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You were chosen\Nbecause you are beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.34,0:06:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,And furthermore,\Nby offering sacrifices,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,we can calm the wrath of Osiris\Nand this country will know peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nonsense! A country\Ncannot become peaceful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.98,0:06:30.34,Default,,0,0,0,,...by offering sacrifices!\N- Queen Deida wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.38,0:06:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,...and nine other girls\Nto be offered in sacrifice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.70,0:06:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ten girls? Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.74,0:06:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,The ten beautiful girls\Nwill be offered in sacrifice..
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.54,0:06:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,...on the first night\Nof the splendid full moon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.66,0:06:43.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I must manage to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.58,0:06:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.50,0:06:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is happening to you?\N- This iron ring hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.34,0:06:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, take this ring off me!\N- Well... All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.62,0:07:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.66,0:07:25.65,Default,,0,0,0,,It's between the two of us now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.30,0:07:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.30,0:07:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Amesisis?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.90,0:07:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the only son of the deceased\NQueen Deida: Amesisis.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.22,0:07:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I am the Princess of Silverland:\NSapphire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.94,0:07:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Princess of Silverland?\NI want to believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Judging by your skill\Nin using the sword,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.22,0:07:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,you are different from the normal girls\Nof this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.90,0:07:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.54,0:08:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I know they mistook you for another,\Nbut I cannot decide alone..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.66,0:08:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,...what to do with you.\N- But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,This country is large\Nand I have no power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.50,0:08:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I will hold a meeting and we will decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, please,\Nwait here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince Amesisis...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, wake up!\NWake up, I said! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.42,0:08:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up! Wake up! Wake\Nup! Wake up! Wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, boy, is your parrot\Ngood at imitating people?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.06,0:08:35.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can imitate anyone from any country!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you able to fly?\N- I have flown all over the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.70,0:08:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't believe him!\NBut he really can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fine friend! You meanie, you're\Nmaking me out to be a liar to everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, fly to my country!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.42,0:08:51.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell a boy named Tink\Nto come help Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.62,0:08:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's very easy!\N- I'll reward you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Alright! Where is your country?\N- It's to the North!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.94,0:08:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Go, fly to the North!\NGo call Tink, understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.02,0:09:04.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Away, to the North!\NAway, to the North!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Nine more girls!\NI will be buried alive with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.02,0:09:23.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince! Prince Amesisis!\NI can't go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince!\NPrince, what will become of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be a sacrificial victim,\Nit's already been decided!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.66,0:09:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh..! Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.54,0:09:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Since we cannot manage to bring back\Nthe girl who escaped to your country,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,you must replace her\Nand sacrifice yourself in her place.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.58,0:09:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,We will prepare a\Nvery honorable sacrificial ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be offered\Nto the late Queen Deida.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It is said that Deida\Nwas the second woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,...most beautiful in the world,\Nafter Cleopatra.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.90,0:10:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,She is dead and now lies\Nmore beautiful than ever in the pyramid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.18,0:10:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But the youth and beauty\Nof the Queen will fade forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.42,0:10:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,if every year there are not\Noffered as sacrificial victims...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.42,0:10:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,...the ten most beautiful maidens\Nof the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.62,0:10:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And you have ten poor girls killed just because you believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.78,0:10:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- ...in a stupid superstition?\N- A superstition?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Prince, do you also believe this implausible story?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.10,0:10:28.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe it because Morufo believes it and assures me that it is the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.54,0:10:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I never tell lies! It is necessary to offer sacrificial victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.14,0:10:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,If we do not offer these victims, your late mother will be destroyed
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.54,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,..and Osiris will punish Egypt!\N- It's a lie, Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.62,0:10:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- Enough!\N- I have nothing more to say!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You and the other nine girls\Nwill all be sacrificed in five days.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.62,0:10:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Until then, enjoy yourselves\Nas much as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not die!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But why is none of you\Ncrying or trying to escape?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.62,0:11:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I was chosen because I am beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.22,0:11:37.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But were you perhaps\Nborn to be buried alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.78,0:11:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, let's escape somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.98,0:11:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we will manage to\Nsave ourselves if we run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.58,0:11:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you Tink?\NPrince Amesisis...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- There is only one\Nway to save you - How?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It is to marry me! If you\Nmarry me, you will not die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, marry me! I\Nlike you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.34,0:12:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,And I can make you truly happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.70,0:12:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Choose another girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.10,0:12:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I do not want to be saved\Nmyself and let nine other girls die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You can still live for three days,\Nyou know. I await your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.66,0:13:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.02,0:13:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, beautiful girls, this is\Na night of the full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.62,0:13:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Osiris...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.54,0:13:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, receive these\Nsacrificial victims...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,...and please, offer youth\Nand beauty to Queen Deida.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.22,0:13:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,May Queen Deida be young!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,May Queen Deida be beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.22,0:13:58.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Enough! No matter how much\Nyou pray, the dead can never again...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.74,0:14:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,...return to being young and beautiful!\N- Fear the wrath of Osiris!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.58,0:14:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,A dead woman does not bloom again!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.62,0:14:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad from the\Nfear of becoming a sacrificial victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.18,0:14:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Lead the victims to the pyramid\Nwhere Queen Deida is sleeping!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.22,0:14:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire! Sapphire,\Nplease, grant my request!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.54,0:14:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Marry me now or it will be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.30,0:14:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!\NSapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.90,0:15:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, is that you?\NTink, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, I'm asking you\Nfor the last time: marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.42,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise it will be too late!\N- Prince Amesisis...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.38,0:15:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to\Ndie, Sapphire! Marry me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.66,0:15:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you repeat it to\Nme endlessly, I won't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.50,0:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am not so petty as to save\Nmyself by letting the other girls die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.82,0:15:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did that,\Nit would be over for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sapphire!\N- Tink, I'm here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.58,0:15:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- What is it?\N- Sapphire! - Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.90,0:15:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.18,0:16:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!\NHelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.62,0:16:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.06,0:16:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire, how cowardly I\Nam! I don't have the courage...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.58,0:16:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,...to go against Morufo\Nand Osiris and save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful not to step\Non that black stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I warned you,\Nstupid boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.54,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,In this pyramid there are\Nmany traps to avoid thieves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.98,0:18:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Osiris, please, receive\Nthese sacrificial victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodbye forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.94,0:18:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That will be your coffin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.42,0:18:43.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Osiris, please help\Nus, I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.14,0:18:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Try to take courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.50,0:18:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please, help us!\N- Calm down and take courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.34,0:18:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I am certain there is\Na secret hole to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.90,0:18:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am sure of it, because the pyramid\Nhas many secret passages.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired! I'm tired!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.06,0:19:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hel... Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.42,0:19:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help!\NA crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.46,0:19:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Help! Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We are being attacked\Nfrom both sides!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.50,0:19:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You saved our lives.\NThank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to sell this boy well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.74,0:19:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,He can be sold for about 300 Yen.\NBoss, it's a real fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.62,0:19:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- But what are you talking about?\N- We are slave traders.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be sold for 300 Yen.\NDon't you think that's a good price?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to sell me?\NNo! No! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.02,0:19:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No! No! No! No!\NI have to help Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.46,0:19:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!\NI really can't stay with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.42,0:19:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, are you going to put me down,\Nyes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.10,0:20:07.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.54,0:20:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I would have sworn there\Nhad to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.74,0:20:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it alone, we have no\Nchoice but to resign ourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.18,0:20:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Osiris, sacrifice, and this\Nsort of thing are superstitions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.34,0:20:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,When you die you can no\Nlonger become beautiful again!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.74,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say those things! I am\Nafraid of Osiris's punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And I am telling you that\Nthere can be no punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.34,0:20:30.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.14,0:21:01.69,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a secret door! Hurry\Nup! Quickly, let's escape from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.90,0:21:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.50,0:21:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, quickly! Here is the exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.10,0:21:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh...! Morufo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:38.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Slave merchant,\Nthis time these girls...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.30,0:21:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,..they have given me a lot of trouble\Nbecause of this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.46,0:21:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Slave merchant?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.62,0:21:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems to me that this year the girls\Nare quite beautiful, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.98,0:21:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- You will pay a good price.\N- All right. - I understand, Morufo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Every year\Nyou choose beautiful girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.90,0:21:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,saying that you offer them\Nas sacrificial victims..
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,...and instead you sell them\Nto a slave merchant!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.90,0:22:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a good trick\Nto say that I kill them...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.46,0:22:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,..to protect\Nthe Queen's beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:04.41,Default,,0,0,0,,..and to appease the wrath of Osiris?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- Tie up the slaves!\N- Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.50,0:22:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn! Did they really have to\Nshut me in a jar full of pepper?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.42,0:22:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Sapphire!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.34,0:22:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If they found me now I could no longer\Nsave Sapphire! What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.74,0:22:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.90,0:22:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Father in heaven,\Nplease forgive me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'll have to make\Nthe camels eat some pepper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, camels
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.34,0:22:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tink, you've finally arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.66,0:22:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, Morufo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.38,0:22:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward...\NWait!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.58,0:23:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I am, Morufo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.82,0:23:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Morufo! Leave her alone\Nand fight against me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.50,0:23:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Sapphire. Now\NI am strong because of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.98,0:23:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I will try to make my country\Na country as good as yours.
